{{!--
	Home hero, full.   {{> "sections/home-hero-full/hero" tagline="…" role="…" …}}

	Two columns: words on the left, a picture on the right that turns into a
	video player in place. Behind both, a slow wash of colour. One call is the
	whole section — it loads its own stylesheet and script.

	sections/home-hero-full/
	  hero.hbs            this — assets, order, parameters passed down
	  parts/background    the wash: CSS mesh, an mp4 loop, film grain
	  parts/copy          ticker, name, tagline, intro, role, aim, subscribe
	  parts/picture       the picture, which becomes the player in place
	  parts/controls      the column on the picture's right border
	  parts/stickers      the pills, the handwritten note, the stamp, the clock
	  hero.css  hero.js   styles and behaviour, in the same order as the parts
	  media/              hero-loop.mp4 + .jpg poster (any seamless loop works)

	FROM GHOST ADMIN, not from parameters
	  name      Settings → General → Site title         (the <h1>)
	  intro     Settings → General → Site description
	  picture   Settings → Design → logo, else the publication cover
	  accounts  Settings → Social accounts
	  subscribe shown when memberships are on and the visitor is signed out

	PARAMETERS — every one optional; a missing one removes its line
	  greeting                  "Hi, I'm"
	  tagline                   one line under the name
	  phrase_1 … phrase_5       the rolling ticker (exactly five; see hero.css §3)
	  role, org, org_url        "Role at Org"
	  where                     a place
	  aim_a, aim_b              "Working towards A / B"
	  cta_label, cta_url        the button beside the subscribe form
	  note                      small print under the form
	  video, video_portrait     YouTube ids: wide cut, and a 9:16 cut for phones

	  THE PERSONALITY — all optional; see parts/stickers and parts/background
	  pattern                   grid · dots · lines, drawn behind everything
	  watermark                 one huge outlined word, low in the corner
	  sticker_1 … sticker_4     pills on the picture's corners
	  sticker_1_icon … _4_icon  an icon name for each (partials/icons)
	  hand                      a handwritten line with an arrow at the picture
	  stamp                     words round a slowly turning stamp
	  clock, clock_label        a time zone, and the words after the time

	The layout needs two blocks in default.hbs:  {{{block "styles"}}} in <head>
	and {{{block "scripts"}}} before </body>.
--}}
{{#contentFor "styles"}}
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{asset "sections/home-hero-full/hero.css"}}">
{{/contentFor}}
{{#contentFor "scripts"}}
	<script src="{{asset "sections/home-hero-full/hero.js"}}" defer></script>
{{/contentFor}}

<section class="im-hero" aria-label="{{t "Introduction"}}">
	{{> "sections/home-hero-full/parts/background"}}

	<div class="im-hero__grid">
		{{> "sections/home-hero-full/parts/copy"}}
		{{> "sections/home-hero-full/parts/picture"}}
	</div>
</section>
